---
# mobsfscan (CI security-scan job) over the native shells. Its INFO rules
# report protections the app doesn't have, such as root detection or
# certificate pinning, on every run, so only warnings and errors fail.
- severity-filter:
    - WARNING
    - ERROR
  ignore-rules:
    # MainActivity is singleTask without taskAffinity="". Open decision,
    # tracked in todo.md; remove these once it's settled.
    - android_task_hijacking1
    - android_task_hijacking2
